# Generated by matugen from the current wallpaper. Do not edit by hand.
#
# btop's theme key list is well-established and widely forked across many
# published themes, but I want to be upfront: I verified the overall
# shell-assignment syntax and structure, not every individual key name
# against btop's own source. If a specific graph or panel doesn't pick up a
# colour, that key name is the first thing to check against a fresh
# `btop --version` install's own default theme file for comparison.

theme[main_bg]="#18181b"
theme[main_fg]="#ffffff"
theme[title]="#ffffff"
theme[hi_fg]="#75f1fa"
